main rows:**i > i
fold rows 0 sum n row (+ sum (fold row 0 acc index item (+ acc item)))

grow limit:i > i
while 1 value (< value limit) (* value 2)

endless > i
while 1 value true value

nested > **i
list *i 2 (list i 0) (list i 2 7 8)

